<body>
<p class="p1"><span class="s1">new:Â </span></p>
<p class="p2"><span class="s1"></span><br></p>
<p class="p2"><span class="s1"></span><br></p>
<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" class="t1">
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td valign="top" class="td1">
        <p class="p1"><span class="s1">Design a complete, modern e-commerce web application UI similar to Shopee or Lazada. Use a clean, vibrant design system with a primary orange/coral accent color (#EE4D2D or similar), white backgrounds, and subtle card shadows. Typography should be Inter or a modern sans-serif.</span></p>
        <p class="p2"><span class="s1"></span><br></p>
        <p class="p1"><span class="s1">---</span></p>
        <p class="p2"><span class="s1"></span><br></p>
        <p class="p1"><span class="s1">## </span><span class="s2">ðŸ”</span><span class="s1"> AUTH SCREENS</span></p>
        <p class="p1"><span class="s1">1. **Login Page** â€“ Email/password form, "Remember me", forgot password link, social login buttons (Google, Facebook), link to Register</span></p>
        <p class="p1"><span class="s1">2. **Register Page** â€“ Full name, email, phone, password, confirm password, terms checkbox, CTA button</span></p>
        <p class="p1"><span class="s1">3. **Forgot Password Page** â€“ Email input + OTP verification step</span></p>
        <p class="p2"><span class="s1"></span><br></p>
        <p class="p1"><span class="s1">---</span></p>
        <p class="p2"><span class="s1"></span><br></p>
        <p class="p1"><span class="s1">## </span><span class="s2">ðŸ </span><span class="s1"> STOREFRONT (User-facing)</span></p>
        <p class="p1"><span class="s1">4. **Homepage** â€“ Top navigation bar (logo, search bar, cart icon, user avatar/login), category icon row, hero banner carousel, flash sale section with countdown timer, product grid (best sellers, recommended), sticky bottom nav for mobile</span></p>
        <p class="p1"><span class="s1">5. **Category / Search Results Page** â€“ Filter sidebar (price range, rating, location, brand), sort dropdown, product card grid with pagination</span></p>
        <p class="p1"><span class="s1">6. **Product Detail Page** â€“ Image gallery with thumbnails, product name, rating stars + review count, price (original + discounted), variant selector (size/color), quantity input, "Add to Cart" &amp; "Buy Now" buttons, shop info bar, product description tabs, reviews section</span></p>
        <p class="p1"><span class="s1">7. **Shopping Cart Page** â€“ Item list with checkbox select, quantity stepper, remove button, price summary sidebar, "Proceed to Checkout" CTA</span></p>
        <p class="p1"><span class="s1">8. **Checkout Page** â€“ Delivery address form, shipping method selector, payment method (COD, card, e-wallet), order summary, place order button</span></p>
        <p class="p1"><span class="s1">9. **Order Confirmation Page** â€“ Success state with order ID, estimated delivery, "Continue Shopping" button</span></p>
        <p class="p2"><span class="s1"></span><br></p>
        <p class="p1"><span class="s1">---</span></p>
        <p class="p2"><span class="s1"></span><br></p>
        <p class="p1"><span class="s1">## </span><span class="s2">ðŸ‘¤</span><span class="s1"> USER ACCOUNT</span></p>
        <p class="p1"><span class="s1">10. **My Profile Page** â€“ Avatar upload, personal info form, change password section</span></p>
        <p class="p1"><span class="s1">11. **My Orders Page** â€“ Tab filter (All / Pending / Processing / Shipped / Delivered / Cancelled), order card list with status badge, "Re-order" and "Review" actions</span></p>
        <p class="p1"><span class="s1">12. **Order Detail Page** â€“ Timeline tracker (Placed â†’ Confirmed â†’ Shipped â†’ Delivered), item list, pricing breakdown, contact support button</span></p>
        <p class="p2"><span class="s1"></span><br></p>
        <p class="p1"><span class="s1">---</span></p>
        <p class="p2"><span class="s1"></span><br></p>
        <p class="p1"><span class="s1">## </span><span class="s2">ðŸ› ï¸</span><span class="s1"> ADMIN DASHBOARD</span></p>
        <p class="p1"><span class="s1">13. **Admin Overview Dashboard** â€“ KPI cards (Revenue, Orders, Products, Users), line chart (revenue over time), bar chart (top categories), recent orders table</span></p>
        <p class="p1"><span class="s1">14. **Product Management Page** â€“ Searchable + filterable data table (image, name, category, price, stock, status), Add/Edit/Delete actions, bulk actions toolbar</span></p>
        <p class="p1"><span class="s1">15. **Add / Edit Product Form** â€“ Product name, category dropdown, description (rich text), price &amp; discount, stock quantity, image upload (multi), variants section, publish toggle</span></p>
        <p class="p1"><span class="s1">16. **Order Management Page** (Admin) â€“ Full orders table with status filter tabs, date range picker, export CSV button, quick status update dropdown per row</span></p>
        <p class="p1"><span class="s1">17. **Order Detail Page** (Admin) â€“ Full order info, customer details, shipping tracking input, status update panel</span></p>
        <p class="p2"><span class="s1"></span><br></p>
        <p class="p1"><span class="s1">---</span></p>
        <p class="p2"><span class="s1"></span><br></p>
        <p class="p1"><span class="s1">## </span><span class="s2">ðŸŽ¨</span><span class="s1"> DESIGN REQUIREMENTS</span></p>
        <p class="p1"><span class="s1">- Fully responsive: Desktop, Tablet, Mobile breakpoints</span></p>
        <p class="p1"><span class="s1">- Consistent component library: buttons (primary/secondary/ghost), input fields, badges, modals, toasts/snackbars, breadcrumbs, pagination</span></p>
        <p class="p1"><span class="s1">- Empty states for cart, orders, search no results</span></p>
        <p class="p1"><span class="s1">- Loading skeleton states for product grids and tables</span></p>
        <p class="p1"><span class="s1">- Dark mode variant (optional but preferred)</span></p>
        <p class="p1"><span class="s1">- Mobile: bottom navigation bar with icons (Home, Category, Cart, Orders, Profile)</span></p>
        <p class="p2"><span class="s1"></span><br></p>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
<p class="p2"><span class="s1"></span><br></p>
